WEBVTT

00:03:58.746 --> 00:04:01.121
like taking time to help
a stranger in need.

00:04:01.163 --> 00:04:04.329
In this context, bad might be 
stronger than good,

00:04:04.371 --> 00:04:07.079
but only because good is more plentiful.

00:04:07.329 --> 00:04:09.746
Think about the last time
you judged someone

00:04:09.788 --> 00:04:11.079
based on their behavior,

00:04:11.121 --> 00:04:15.121
especially a time when you really feel
like you changed your mind about someone.

00:04:15.371 --> 00:04:19.079
Was the behavior that caused you
to update your impression

00:04:19.121 --> 00:04:21.579
something you'd expect anyone to do,

00:04:21.621 --> 00:04:24.079
or was it something 
totally out of the ordinary?